# Agent Maria Hill: "Whenever Agent Maria Hill becomes tapped to pay a teamwork cost, put a +1/+1 counter on her and draw a card." On
# turn 4 Bot2 attacks with two Ageless Guardians. Bot1 casts one Helicarrier Strike (Teamwork 2) tapping Maria (power 2): she gets a
# counter and Bot1 draws (its hand stays at 2: one card cast, one drawn). Bot1 casts the other tapping Cabal Evangel (power 2)
# instead: no trigger, no second counter, no second draw (its hand is 1 after casting it).

